        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2012 NBA Summer League, 2012 NBA Draft\n- People: Damian Lillard, Josh Selby\n- Organizations: NBA\n- Teams: Portland Trail Blazers, Memphis Grizzlies\n- Awards: NBA Summer League MVP honors, NBA Rookie of the Year\n\nFacts:\n- The NBA ran the 2012 NBA Summer League just after the 2012 NBA Draft.\n- Damian Lillard of the Portland Trail Blazers and Josh Selby of the Memphis Grizzlies won the MVP honors for the 2012 NBA Summer League.\n- Damian Lillard was selected by Portland with the sixth overall pick in the 2012 NBA Draft.\n- After the 2012 NBA Draft, Damian Lillard won the NBA Rookie of the Year award by unanimous decision.",
